 <metadata>
  <name>Prestwich via Heaton Edge</name>
  <desc>So from McD cross over to the left side of Bury Old Road then begin the run turning left on Thatch Leach Lane run until the Frigate pub and turn right own Sandgate Road crossing over the the motorway.
Keep running until you reach then take a quick shimmy to the left before turning right onto the road next to the reservoir (St Margarets Road)  just follow that around until you reach Bury Old Road again.  Turn left for a little run until you take a right along Heys Road (Tattoo parlour) keep following that all the way down into Prestwich town centre. Cross under the tram and run down fairfax then take a right at M&amp;S keep running to run back under the motorway take the left subway back up and return to McD start point.</desc>
  <author>
   <name>Run Together Whitefield</name>
   <link href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/44862010"/>
  </author>
  <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors">
   <year>2020</year>
   <license>https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright</license>
  </copyright>
  <link href="https://www.strava.com/routes/3266065942555193682"/>
 </metadata>
